---
import Slide from "@/components/slides/Slide.astro";
import Code from "@/components/slides/Code.astro";

const notes =
    "Run the fixed demo: the order goes through in milliseconds.\n\n- the fix: move one line. commit, then hand off\n- all or nothing? outbox: write the job as a row in the same transaction; it can't start before the lock is gone\n- deadlines (idle_in_transaction_session_timeout, lock_timeout): off by default, don't fix the bug, but the next freeze becomes an error you can see\n- likely question: would a timeout on the await fix it? no. it turns the freeze into an error, but the receipt may have gone out and the order rolls back to unpaid. a timeout is an alarm, not a fix\n- the rule: never await anything while a transaction is open";
---

<Slide
    kicker="scenario 1 · the fix"
    title="give the key back before you send anyone."
    notes={notes}
>
    <div class="s-cols">
        <Code
            lang="rust"
            label="before"
            lines={[
                ["// orders.rs - mark_paid(...)", "", "muted"],
                "let tx = db.transaction().await?;",
                'tx.execute("update orders …", &[&id]).await?;',
                ["send_receipt(id).await?;", "stuck", "accent"],
                ["tx.commit().await?;", "", "muted"],
            ]}
        />
        <Code
            lang="rust"
            label="after"
            lines={[
                ["// orders.rs - mark_paid(...)", "", "muted"],
                "let tx = db.transaction().await?;",
                'tx.execute("update orders …", &[&id]).await?;',
                ["tx.commit().await?;", "lock released"],
                "send_receipt(id).await?;",
            ]}
        />
    </div>
    <div class="s-card is-accent mt-auto">
        <p class="s-card-label">the rule</p>
        <p>never await anything while a transaction is open.</p>
    </div>
</Slide>
